["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Forgotten Godmother of Economic Literature Edgeworth box marginalists labor theory of value DSGE racked rent\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-oddlots-比简-奥斯汀还畅销的她-因在小说里说教太重被经济学史遗忘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">43:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>比简·奥斯汀还畅销的她，因在小说里说教太重被经济学史遗忘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她的小说比《国富论》原著好读得多，却因为教育意味太浓，在简·奥斯汀式自然主义叙事兴起后被读者和经济学史一起抛弃。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">经济思想史</span><span class=\"tag\">女性经济学家</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"反地产逻辑，为什么成就了阿那亚｜钦文对话马寅\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-wangqinwen-阿那亚的成功靠的是没有退路-不是战略远见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f06d53df338a0f19-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"王\"><span class=\"dur\">28:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">王钦文</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>阿那亚的成功靠的是没有退路，不是战略远见</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马寅说如果2012年还能像别的开发商一样快进快出赚快钱，他绝不会死磕阿那亚——是十亿贷款和只剩这一个项目的绝境，逼出了这套反地产逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">长期主义</span><span class=\"tag\">社区运营</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"重新定义个人电脑，老黄到底凭什么？RTX Spark深度解析 PRISM MXC Windows on ARM PAIR Prefill/Decode MOE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-laoshi-rtx-spark芯片没变-英伟达要的不是性能而是pc定义权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">老</div><span class=\"dur\">24:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">老石谈芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>RTX Spark芯片没变，英伟达要的不是性能而是PC定义权</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这颗芯片几乎就是去年发布的DGX Spark换了操作系统，老黄真正想要的不是跑分赢家，而是把CPU、GPU、内存、系统捆成一套只认英伟达规则的PC新架构。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">CUDA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AI Compute Comes in Rectangles — Erik Bernhardsson, Modal CEO BYOC Neoclouds spot capacity FDE MFU\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-latentspace-gpu-稀缺的真正病根-算力只能整块按三年期打包购买/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7cf8550aeeab084a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>GPU 稀缺的真正病根：算力只能整块按三年期打包购买</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说，GPU 短缺最大的问题不是抢不到卡，而是几乎所有产能都打包成三到六个月后交付的三年期合约出售，这和大多数客户真实的忽高忽低的需求完全对不上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力采购</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU稀缺</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Here’s Why Experts Keep Being Wrong About the Future radical uncertainty hindsight bias\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-goodfight-预测失败不是数据问题-是未来本身不可知/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">9:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>预测失败不是数据问题，是未来本身不可知</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">手握数据、模型和算力的专家照样在2008年集体失算，因为未来不是等信息补全的拼图，而是一张还没画出来的空白画布。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">不确定性</span><span class=\"tag\">预测失误</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What will computer chips look like in 2045? EUV High-NA EUV Gate-all-around (GAA) CFET Backside power Hybrid bonding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-dwarkesh-就算无限砸钱-先进芯片产能也只能翻倍-不是十倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21bf8bafac799fac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>就算无限砸钱，先进芯片产能也只能翻倍，不是十倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英特尔CTO说，哪怕拿出无限资本开支，现有全球芯片制造设备存量也只能让先进制程晶圆产能翻一倍——而AI算力需求过去十年每年增长三倍，缺口只会越拉越大。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半导体制造</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片产能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Recommendation Engine for Commodity Traders — Anekha Sokhal, Moshi RecSys MORSE Fulbright Scholarship ICLR Vision Language Model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-latentspace-这家创业公司说自己不是新彭博-而是交易员的推荐系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c5deeb7411e2beff-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">26:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>这家创业公司说自己不是新彭博，而是交易员的推荐系统</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">创始人把公司定位为彭博、Claude和Netflix的结合体：价值不在给交易员更多数据，而在于像Netflix一样主动推送他们自己想不到该看的二阶关联信号。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI创业</span><span class=\"tag\">大宗商品交易</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New Apex Predator: CrowdStrike CEO George Kurtz on Adversaries Armed With AI Agents pyramid of pain breakout time ablated models digital twin distillation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-nopriors-ai抹平攻击门槛-脚本小子也能用上国家级黑客的本事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ad8f4d231b5e5ea8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">45:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>AI抹平攻击门槛：脚本小子也能用上国家级黑客的本事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">开源大模型装在家用电脑上就能造勒索软件，入侵后平均29分钟、最快27秒就能在系统里横向移动。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span><span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Leveraged ETFs Really Work (Marco Sammon &amp; Chris Murray) | #432 convexity bonus volatility drag break-even return swap expected log wealth\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-rationalreminder-3倍杠杆etf跑赢正股-标的股票得先涨170/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>3倍杠杆ETF跑赢正股，标的股票得先涨170%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">杠杆ETF每天只盯日收益、不盯年化倍数：日波动5%的标的，3倍产品要涨170%才能反超正股本身——门槛随波动率指数级跳升。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">杠杆ETF</span><span class=\"tag\">波动率损耗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bhaskar Sunkara Thinks the Market Has a Place Under Socialism market socialism soft budget constraint benchmark wage DSA Rawlsian liberalism labor-managed firm\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-oddlots-激进版社会主义-土地全部公有-但房租仍由市场决定/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">53:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>激进版社会主义：土地全部公有，但房租仍由市场决定</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他主张，社会主义不必靠配给：把土地和住房全部收归公有后，仍可以保留按市场定价的租金和搬迁自由，用价格而不是配给来分配空间。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">市场社会主义</span><span class=\"tag\">工人所有制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The charity that is also a time machine donor-advised fund (DAF) Schedule B chimera\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-complexsys-美国的捐赠基金其实是个时间机器-减税现在拿-捐钱以后再说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b98a243f0a884fd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">27:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>美国的捐赠基金其实是个时间机器：减税现在拿，捐钱以后再说</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这是一套合法的「慈善时间机器」：把钱存进去立刻减税，捐给谁、何时捐可以往后拖很多年——Anthropic员工未来的巨额捐款很可能就走这条路。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">慈善</span><span class=\"tag\">税务</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Origins of Constantinople Tetrarchy Solidus Milion Notitia Hippodrome\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-ancients-罗马城早被废弃-君士坦丁堡只是把迁都做到了极致/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/83ea79d083d093bd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>罗马城早被废弃，君士坦丁堡只是把迁都做到了极致</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戴克里先以来，米兰、尼科米底亚、特里尔早已分走罗马的权力和宫廷；君士坦丁只是把这套迁都惯例做大、做永久，并冠上自己的名字。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">拜占庭帝国</span><span class=\"tag\">罗马帝国</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Arvind Krishna &amp; Nikesh Arora: Quantum Threat, Open vs Frontier AI, AI Cyber Warfare &amp; SaaS Collapse QBI (Quantum Benchmarking Initiative) logical qubit post-quantum cryptography ZDR (zero data retention) open weight model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-allin-加密硬盘现在被偷-五年后也可能被量子计算机破解/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2252b98cbb7fdf85-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">40:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>加密硬盘现在被偷，五年后也可能被量子计算机破解</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">IBM和Palo Alto Networks的CEO说，量子计算机预计2030年前后就能破解今天的加密算法，而后量子密码学方案早已现成，只是企业一直懒得换。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子计算</span><span class=\"tag\">密码学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"716. King Arthur: The Truth Behind the Legend (Part 4) Historia Britonum dux bellorum Annales Cambriae Mirabilia Britanniae Y Gododdin cataphract\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-restishistory-亚瑟之名只流行于六七世纪-这是他存在的最强证据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/72c546eadef77e70-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>亚瑟之名只流行于六七世纪，这是他存在的最强证据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">现存证据没有一条能单独证明亚瑟真实存在，但「亚瑟」作为罗马人名只在不列颠贵族间流行过六七世纪这一小段时间，这个空窗至今无人能解释。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世纪史</span><span class=\"tag\">史源考据</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Can Dividend Investing Give You Yield AND Growth? yield trap free cash flow payout ratio net share issuance\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-mastersinbiz-股息不是收益率游戏-是识别哪家公司真能把现金还给你/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f5dd15b785a2d85d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">23:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>股息不是收益率游戏，是识别哪家公司真能把现金还给你</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">股息是现金，骗不了人；作者用自己在金融危机前以51美元卖出花旗的真实交易，说明高股息率常常是价格暴跌的假象，而非公司变好的信号。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">股息投资</span><span class=\"tag\">价值投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Cure to Founder Burnout Isn&#x27;t Rest | 6 Solo Founders swallow the frog chief of staff\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-solofounders-创始人倦怠的解药不是休息-而是重新找到动力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/18d01623f9e39d48-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">22:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>创始人倦怠的解药不是休息，而是重新找到动力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">在Lindy熬了两年多后，Flo以为自己需要半年假期才能恢复，但真正让他走出倦怠的，是重新找到动力的那一刻，精力几乎立刻就回来了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创始人倦怠</span><span class=\"tag\">独自创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI lab staff: Has your project been overtaken by events? 8 strategic updates | Rob Wiblin RSI (recursive self-improvement) CoT monitoring Overton window eval awareness mech interp model organism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-eightythousand-ai员工能拖慢失控进程-但这份议价权正在快速清零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d87b66f6770249f5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">14:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>AI员工能拖慢失控进程，但这份议价权正在快速清零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">技术员工能靠罢工式不配合为对齐研究拖出时间，但这种杠杆只在公司还离不开他们时成立——一旦模型自动化了他们的工作，这份权力就会归零，所以能用就得现在用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">递归自我改进</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Unearthed! in October 2026, Part 2 borrow pit maquette clinker-built\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-stuffmissed-中国壁画两千年不褪色-秘密是血液而非颜料/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>中国壁画两千年不褪色，秘密是血液而非颜料</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">左江花山岩画两千年保持鲜红，科学分析发现颜料用石灰浆混血液作粘合剂，部分血液来自产后女性，可能带有母系社会的仪式意味。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古</span><span class=\"tag\">沉船</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Missing Infrastructure for AI Agents: Documents | Reducto’s Adit Abraham VLM IDP harness recall\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-a16z-大模型处理长文档最容易犯的错-是悄悄漏掉信息/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">38:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>大模型处理长文档最容易犯的错，是悄悄漏掉信息</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">权威基准测试发现，顶尖大模型抽取长文档时精确率很高，但会不动声色地漏掉信息，这种错误在生产环境里几乎无法被发现。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">文档处理</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"James Robinson on What It Looks Like When a State is Failing extractive institutions inclusive institutions creative destruction monopsony critical juncture\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-oddlots-诺奖得主断言-中国经济迟早要为政治集权买单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">37:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>诺奖得主断言：中国经济迟早要为政治集权买单</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他认为中国增长靠的是经济从汲取性转向包容性制度，但政治权力从未被制衡——权力导致腐败、绝对权力导致绝对腐败，这决定了增长终将脱轨，只是时间问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">制度经济学</span><span class=\"tag\">拉美政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Broomology (BROOMS) with Cate O’Connell-Richards besom broomcorn johnny flying ointment broom squire Malleus Maleficarum\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-ologies-女巫飞天传说的真实来源-致幻药膏涂在扫帚柄上使用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>女巫飞天传说的真实来源：致幻药膏涂在扫帚柄上使用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所谓女巫骑扫帚飞天，脱胎自她们把含致幻生物碱的药膏涂抹在扫帚柄上、经粘膜吸收产生的飞行幻觉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民俗史</span><span class=\"tag\">手工艺</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI for the Fortune 2000: How Tenex Builds an AI-Native SDLC — Alex Lieberman &amp; CJ Hess MetaHarness FDE (forward deployed engineer) RBAC AMP Kill My SaaS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-latentspace-多数企业用上了ai聊天-但智能体真正投产的不到5/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9a3ee5d13ee0cdf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">43:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>多数企业用上了AI聊天，但智能体真正投产的不到5%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">企业给员工装上Claude和Codex很容易，90%已经做了；但把智能体真正部署进生产、干非工程的活，只有5%做到——这中间的落差才是这期的核心数据。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业AI落地</span><span class=\"tag\">按产出付薪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"155. 和科沃斯钱程聊，父与子、企二代接班的样本与肌理、机器人，和我内心的追寻 physical AI FSD repetition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-zhangxiaojun-29岁当上科沃斯ceo-他说那是愚昧之巅不是人生巅峰/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/655ca401e97f9e11-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>29岁当上科沃斯CEO,他说那是愚昧之巅不是人生巅峰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他接任CEO时以为到达人生巅峰，后来才明白那是一次史诗级错判：战略方向全对，却因为不懂公司怎么做决策，两三年都没把自己和组织的神经接上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企二代接班</span><span class=\"tag\">出海</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"#887: Q&amp;A with Tim — The 4-Hour Workweek in a World of AI, Rebuilding Personal Agency, The 4-Hour Body After 40, and More DEAL framework Oryx red teaming accelerated TMS vagal nerve stimulation Gymnastic Strength Training (GST)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-timferriss-ai不会省时间-只会把垃圾工作做得更快/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4859313b1789a4e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Tim Ferriss</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>AI不会省时间，只会把垃圾工作做得更快</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">没有先定义和砍掉该做的事，AI只是加速器：它不会创造闲暇，只会把琐碎、无关紧要的任务放大成更多工作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">个人效率</span><span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n</div></div></a>"]